  Yoh pushes her fear aside and presses the buzzer on the Sakisaka house's front gate.<K>
  Fuminori wasn't in class today. Is he home? He couldn't have sent those awful messages, could he?<K> She doesn't even want to consider the possibility, so she forces the unwelcome thought from her mind.

  There's no response from the intercom.<K>
  Yoh doesn't know, of course, that Omi stood in the same spot one week ago, staring at the silent intercom with the same confusion that Yoh is experiencing now.<K>
